    "title": "Fourth of July Sales: Your Guide to the Best Menswear Deals of 2024",
    "text": "• Fourth of July sales are offering significant discounts on menswear.\n• Retailers are providing discounts on everyday staples and high-end designer pieces.\n• Abercrombie & Fitch is offering 20-50% off almost everything, plus an additional 20% off sale items.\n• Key items at Abercrombie include the Linen Button-Up Shirt and Baggy 5-Pocket Pants.\n• Alex Mill's summer sale features 40-60% off the entire collection, including the cotton-linen Cooper Suit for under $275.\n• Banana Republic is offering up to 60% off on 300 pieces from their summer collection, with an additional 20% off.\n• Standout items at Banana Republic include the Cashmere-Linen Crew-Neck Sweater.",
